index 4479b53..4cfff6b 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -9,6 +9,17 @@ pnpm install && pnpm run start
 
 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+Client-side navigation keeps the five most recently visited page views in a
+persistent DOM container. Returning to one reuses its elements, input state,
+and event listeners. Inactive views are hidden and inert; older views are
+removed when the cache fills. Astro still fetches the destination and updates
+its metadata, styles, history, and scroll position normally. A full reload
+clears the cache.
+
+Sign-in and sign-up views opt out via `cacheView={false}` on `Layout`.
+Form navigations invalidate the cache, and same-URL navigations use fresh content.
+Run `pnpm test` for the DOM cache tests (Node.js 22.18+).
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
